#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:183
msgid "Internal activities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:185
msgid ""
"Alongside the execution time for a *change*, the time a taken to process "
"internal  _snapd_ activities, called *ensure activities*, is also tracked. "
"Ensure activities are performed on a regular basis, and they occasionally "
"generate new tasks, as changes, to continue an initial action. They include "
"the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:187
msgid "`auto-refresh`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:188
msgid "`become-operational` (Ubuntu Core only)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:189
msgid "`install-system` (Ubuntu Core only)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:190
msgid "`refresh-catalogs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:191
msgid "`refresh-hints`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:192
msgid "`seed` (Ubuntu Core only)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:194
msgid ""
"Tracking the execution times of such ensure activities can be useful. For "
"example, *auto-refresh* involves multiple processes for various already-"
"installed snaps, including connecting to the Snap Store. Timing information "
"can therefore help troubleshoot refresh issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:196
msgid ""
"Use the `--ensure=` argument to see the timing details for the latest "
"specified ensure activity, or with the optional `--all` argument to show "
"timing data for every execution of the ensure activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/how-snaps-work/snap-performance.md:198
msgid ""
"$ snap debug timings --ensure=refresh-catalogs\n"
"ID                Status        Doing      Undoing  Summary\n"
"refresh-catalogs                309ms            -  \n"
" ^                               69ms            -    query store for "
"sections\n"
" ^                              170ms            -    query store for "
"catalogs\n"
msgstr ""

